<description>&lt;p&gt;Prime Minister Al-Zaidi has assumed direct control of Iraq's intelligence service while Iran intensifies pressure over militia activities and PJAK presence. Baghdad and Damascus advanced talks on the Sharaa pipeline, border security and oil exports, and the Iraqi government signed a gas capture agreement with US firm Morgan Hughes. Security forces dismantled a drug-trafficking network, arresting 31 suspects, and Erbil police detained four suspects in connection with a woman's murder, while the PMF denied having paid Iranian advisers. A memorial was unveiled in Erbil for victims of the 2024 Iranian missile attack.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE56dWd2SnVfVU5tZVo5azc3Q3Q5QXFkUUpWeVFIOEp6SWZFQzFzWWVnRVRfa2hGSU01MlRPd2ZlMTJFS2YzcXRhb2hDYUxjc29YX20xRUdOZEozUXJjaHc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Rudaw&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiygFBVV95cUxOLVJ3OUFfOFpHdzVfbnNwTEFNUDZjalNLc3BxYXRkVW1DQzZOdU1HQWRKdFB2elV5STZ6XzQwZkpaNUJCb01UcXFtTlFpdjVHY2JpSFNBck8wT0loR0FET2FpSmZnN0RBQjVjYWZDbElSWDd2alAzdHdVUzBlQWxxRXdEZG5lc2VIYnBLR3RPQmlub1FiTzZSbWJCM3pZQm9iYWFCSk8tZHppXzZBb2pXS0tackhscXlUeHhvRGs3dlRkY0dEdTZjbThR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Arab News PK&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxNZlhKXzRaMVhDRVZ3MlRTaEpPNFJoUXl3U01SckpFOVllWmtvTE9rcy00c2VhMTAtcjZwcFFoMW1ZQnhld3R5czQ4QnRxT2ZuZDNaR1hPa0RzMUFNeXEwMVE0dzAwbzRUdW1ValN3ZVhsQzNVUTkzd1RFRHFwRkZpRXdIcklVZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;شفق نيوز&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxPbGJsR1hYZkt1V3NNTV9UbGVRMzNXeUk5Nm1PU0IweU5FWWNWUmNJZm03cGJHUlBWVXRYUUlYNDVYSVdyczJ4ZVNCWjRmUUxHNjJSdnZhaVVoM1pKOHZiakhoT1dUTEZBOTdJQ0lZaGRtcDMzTkduYmtNTWRfTTRxRjU5LUJ4TmMzU1F4NE5wb0toa0o1V1NPTG5ocFR3c2tGMHkxREQ2ME9jLVFzTkdDbWdmYw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Kurdistan24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;